From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TripleU <182648541+TripleU613@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:40:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] J714s release 4: firmware j714s10 (boot mounts from the
 booted partitions)

Re-pinned from betizzel/omarchy-m5 0abeef9: omarchy-aurora-firmware
20261014.j714s10 (3e98e8fb..., 49407 bytes) adds aurora-boot-mounts-generator,
which mounts /boot and /boot/efi from the partitions the system booted from,
so a second Omarchy install on the same disk can't take its kernel updates
(docs/duplicate-boot-ids.md). Nothing else changes; the kernel pins stay at
7.3.0-17.v272-4-ARCH. Set j714s-dev-runtime-228cfc8f0fa9.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
